WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.867 --> 00:00:03.002
-Ethan, you've acted in

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.838
and directed
so many great movies,

00:00:04.838 --> 00:00:06.973
but I wanted to see if you're
a big enough fan

00:00:06.973 --> 00:00:10.110
that you can summarize a movie
in just 5 seconds.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:12.979
It is time for five-second
summaries.

00:00:12.979 --> 00:00:18.451
-Here we go!
-♪ 1-2-3-4 5-Second Summaries ♪

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.919
-Alright bud, now here's how
the game works.

00:00:19.919 --> 00:00:21.821
We're going to be given the name
of a movie.

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:23.823
As soon as you see
the title on your card

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:27.393
or on your screen, you have
5 seconds to describe the plot

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:30.196
the best you can and try to make
me guess what it is.

00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.399
Alright, we're partners here.

00:00:32.399 --> 00:00:34.734
-Okay. But I can't say
the lead actor

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:37.603
and I can't say the name of
the movie, or I have to --

00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:38.838
it's like charades or something.
Right?

00:00:38.838 --> 00:00:40.439
-Yeah. You can't use words in
the title,

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:42.542
can't use catchphrases,
any names.

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:45.811
You're just describing the plot
of the movie in 5 seconds.

00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:46.980
-Okay, very good.
-Alright, good.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.281
Alright, we're going to
take turns.

00:00:48.281 --> 00:00:50.717
Ethan, since you're my guest,
you're up first.

00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:53.385 line:0%
Let's put 5 seconds on
the clock.

00:00:53.385 --> 00:00:56.022 line:0%
Take a look at the movie on
your first card,

00:00:56.022 --> 00:00:59.759 line:0%
and when you're ready, start.

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:00.826 line:0%
-Okay.

00:01:00.826 --> 00:01:03.462 line:0%
Here we go
Peter Weir directed,

00:01:03.462 --> 00:01:07.200 line:0%
a young baby is born,
and he's on TV his whole life.

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.033 line:0%
-Oh, "The Truman Show."

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:09.702 line:0%
[ Ding ]

00:01:09.702 --> 00:01:11.504 line:0%
