00:01:12.638 --> 00:01:15.174 line:0%
All right, that's what
I'm talking about.

00:01:15.174 --> 00:01:16.275 line:0%
See, I knew it.
-Alright, you're good.

00:01:16.275 --> 00:01:17.776 line:0%
The pressure is on me now.

00:01:17.776 --> 00:01:19.945 line:0%
-No, no. We're partners.
C'mon, we got this, buddy.

00:01:19.945 --> 00:01:21.114 line:0%
Here we go.
-Okay.

00:01:21.114 --> 00:01:22.348 line:0%
