00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:32.291 line:0%
-"Ferris Bueller's Day Off".

00:01:32.291 --> 00:01:33.793 line:0%
-That's right!
[ Ding ]

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:36.529 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:37.830 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:39.465
That's what I'm talking about.

00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:41.701
